{"3429980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Terrestrial planet", "steam_appid": 3429980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose different storylines to interpret various stories from scratch, from slash and burn farming to cutting-edge technology on a distant planet similar to Earth. You can choose different biological communities and geographical locations as birthplaces, take care of the emotions of the characters to meet their various needs, gradually develop and grow, recruit soldiers to resist foreign enemies or capture other regions or countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The existing main mechanisms include construction, building, underground excavation, random terrain, biological communities, recruitment, siege, planting, cooking, medicine, mining, military, production, hunting, personalized villagers and their performances, resource management, power system, temperature system,aerospace system, physical health system surgery, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial mechanism demonstration is as follows:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/3912a4eb756bb98f1d633e792a3de608.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/3912a4eb756bb98f1d633e792a3de608.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/3912a4eb756bb98f1d633e792a3de608.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Construction System: With a flexible construction system, you can unleash your imagination to build high-rise castles or dig underground to become a caveman.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/879b945fd9c2ba4dbe8215ede8d2d42f.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/879b945fd9c2ba4dbe8215ede8d2d42f.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/879b945fd9c2ba4dbe8215ede8d2d42f.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Power system: generate electricity, store electricity, consume electricity, and use electricity units reasonably to maintain normal electricity demand for residents.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/22b84ed44ef5c73850f12ec8dc5042a4.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/22b84ed44ef5c73850f12ec8dc5042a4.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/22b84ed44ef5c73850f12ec8dc5042a4.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defense system: Various turrets need to be arranged reasonably with the building, and the defense effect of different formations will vary greatly.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/d1d28f1e4feadefa1452cd33bf6bde35.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/d1d28f1e4feadefa1452cd33bf6bde35.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/d1d28f1e4feadefa1452cd33bf6bde35.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space system: Launch rockets, send various types of satellites into orbit, achieve different functions, or build space stations to send residents up. Space stations can synthesize unique resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/1e8ca471884dbec4b5902fc92368138a.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/1e8ca471884dbec4b5902fc92368138a.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/1e8ca471884dbec4b5902fc92368138a.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Military system: It can recruit soldiers and form different branches according to their attributes, which require the production of different weapons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/0846904f4baad61370ad6156c18c14ec.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/0846904f4baad61370ad6156c18c14ec.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/0846904f4baad61370ad6156c18c14ec.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This is a randomly generated world with infinite possibilities. Use your intelligence to continuously expand your population and unify the entire planet.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose different storylines to interpret various stories from scratch, from slash and burn farming to cutting-edge technology on a distant planet similar to Earth. You can choose different biological communities and geographical locations as birthplaces, take care of the emotions of the characters to meet their various needs, gradually develop and grow, recruit soldiers to resist foreign enemies or capture other regions or countries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The existing main mechanisms include construction, building, underground excavation, random terrain, biological communities, recruitment, siege, planting, cooking, medicine, mining, military, production, hunting, personalized villagers and their performances, resource management, power system, temperature system,aerospace system, physical health system surgery, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial mechanism demonstration is as follows:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/3912a4eb756bb98f1d633e792a3de608.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/3912a4eb756bb98f1d633e792a3de608.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/3912a4eb756bb98f1d633e792a3de608.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Construction System: With a flexible construction system, you can unleash your imagination to build high-rise castles or dig underground to become a caveman.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/879b945fd9c2ba4dbe8215ede8d2d42f.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/879b945fd9c2ba4dbe8215ede8d2d42f.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/879b945fd9c2ba4dbe8215ede8d2d42f.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Power system: generate electricity, store electricity, consume electricity, and use electricity units reasonably to maintain normal electricity demand for residents.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/22b84ed44ef5c73850f12ec8dc5042a4.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/22b84ed44ef5c73850f12ec8dc5042a4.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/22b84ed44ef5c73850f12ec8dc5042a4.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Defense system: Various turrets need to be arranged reasonably with the building, and the defense effect of different formations will vary greatly.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/d1d28f1e4feadefa1452cd33bf6bde35.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/d1d28f1e4feadefa1452cd33bf6bde35.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/d1d28f1e4feadefa1452cd33bf6bde35.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space system: Launch rockets, send various types of satellites into orbit, achieve different functions, or build space stations to send residents up. Space stations can synthesize unique resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/1e8ca471884dbec4b5902fc92368138a.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/1e8ca471884dbec4b5902fc92368138a.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/1e8ca471884dbec4b5902fc92368138a.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Military system: It can recruit soldiers and form different branches according to their attributes, which require the production of different weapons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/0846904f4baad61370ad6156c18c14ec.poster.avif?t=1778835431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/0846904f4baad61370ad6156c18c14ec.webm?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429980/extras/0846904f4baad61370ad6156c18c14ec.mp4?t=1778835431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This is a randomly generated world with infinite possibilities. Use your intelligence to continuously expand your population and unify the entire planet.</p>", "short_description": "On a planet with a biome climate similar to Earth, manage your residents from basic construction and planting, develop and research various cutting-edge technologies, recruit soldiers to form troops, resist foreign enemies or actively conquer other countries, and unify this distant planet.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea